<title>SPAIN: Spain's Bankoa suspended after counter bid - CNMV.</title>
<headline>Spain's Bankoa suspended after counter bid - CNMV.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's stock market watchdog CNMV said on  Friday it was suspending trade in Bankoa after a counter bid for the  banking group was presented.</p>
<p>Sociedad Cooperativa de Credito Caja Rural Vasca had launched an offer  in July to buy 100 percent of Bankoa at 3,000 pesetas per share, an  offer that Bankoa rejected.  </p>
<p>Last week Bankoa's board rejected the Caja Rural Vasca offer, recommending  that shareholders wait for an offer to be presented by France's Credit  Agricole.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
